{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3a0288675877306bed08889e07d1ed82733f73eaf7b058998c94dd9bdf0558f1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:661ccf74cd2582816f150ad2a08b0e4e8b42729f601c62422fcb48e32a40ed95",
      "text": "惊喜礼物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e15f8953e2c2443c9d2216b9dcffcd03691179543dd2f006990ab8e87c7f954",
      "text": "某天录制的间隙，桐生去向前来录影的熟人师父打招呼，收到了提前给的生日礼物。在回忆着这一年的点滴回到休息室后，不知为何，九郎却让他坐在那里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:661ccf74cd2582816f150ad2a08b0e4e8b42729f601c62422fcb48e32a40ed95",
      "text": "惊喜礼物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e61b7b44959b6bab569cb95d5a75da74466eeb7d5086e745dec4de5103af7d9",
      "text": "各位辛苦了。离下次录制还有点时间，\n大家可以好好休息一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:875ea40400632be138a73bfddbb60c823f91ef4b525280e1dd861a2cdc2fc84f",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4d6da9cc33d0c99600d5da7846a842883dfc6d4a6692a7f7fb17b2bc5bace75",
      "text": "既然收到了慰问的点心，\n回休息室后要不要喝杯茶呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d13fd8526c0733255e0d7b648a34417525becc7b81396d2b96aded45236225d",
      "text": "吾辈要稍微出去一趟。\n点心记得给我留一份喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67b071783e47ebad8ad128795e97b7e53a41e227b8cebf84c1414f2c2683f9e6",
      "text": "要是去买东西的话，我去就可以哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31a68ab73baa3ea2e73b733ecc32bfa131e79122b5824ad1cb85be12bddca849",
      "text": "是去熟人的休息室啦喵～。\n只是顺便打个招呼马上就回来喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0122726ce7ee3c2a84316b95b94b4c4b5305da2d972573c41ef596a79c4f20b8",
      "text": "啊啊，是这么回事啊。\n路上小心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09ef70bc8737febf918009e6cbbc049c7d44c62a202d4cf592a9b93715559272",
      "text": "请在规定时间内回来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb41a139c1ad259d36c7c3e4991981307c931e1789b8c40556ebadd7fbe1f9a",
      "text": "师父，辛苦了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:217df76f54739cdecc99f558384098ab08a68842df2ec68fdc1896efa18e7344",
      "text": "哎呀……辛苦了。原来在同一个电视台啊。\n专程过来真是谢谢你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ab97b339a050f5714db189cb153058ba2ecf1c9d71236c87c3982d757ece522",
      "text": "说起来，你是不是快过生日了。让我先祝贺你一下吧。\n生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f86bce2785c3c66d20315589096a84faa8a630c30fbbe7f955597f75f71f053",
      "text": "喵！谢谢师父喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cc0e4579b937d0d0881b7e777062732ca3d2540edd0f8c498d8bac2f37b1461",
      "text": "（已经到这个时候了喵。距离去年的生日，\n不知不觉都过了一年，真是令人惊讶喵～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baac72dec27c51cd2d258bff963bc184c2da6e400f15c13a3c61017b0702003e",
      "text": "（自从遇到制作人君、蝴蝶先生、\n九郎君以后，每天都净是开心事）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cec329cefb40a62ccf39f95c6d16603693eac3e163e91252d709231f2d55c669",
      "text": "（和大家待在一起的话，\n别说一天了，连一年都过得飞快呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e725ae3f4ae7e82a763b3109ebff447f4036274d638a4d990bb89eddb815507",
      "text": "（和专心致志的时候，\n又是截然不同的速度喵）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a3098c1f427887b06c5a94c1eb8f60975fcdcbc55bf28256680cd1fe52a8b8e",
      "text": "你作为偶像在电视和杂志上活跃的身影，\n我都有在看哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6ab8f24d0cded47ed6c7150d2b0137bd63ef760fbb6e052685b0997d5a6807c",
      "text": "不仅是作为落语家，\n我也很期待你作为偶像的成长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76672a45b1f68108f339b7304a19755428fc6dbd7cb50d04cbaa9d5b3bada83d",
      "text": "为了今后也能让师父这么夸赞，\n吾辈会继续努力的喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1f4a9ec9b314ef957a4b0b3d11cf8381aa768ba5fbc91cb3e040ddd518f5aa9",
      "text": "好像有人来了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d787a78bec5dd1589b635b536a84dae69aeb8e8e9aef8ee07d6640aac3b63d7",
      "text": "吾辈就此告退了喵。\n下次再来拜访喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913fa7a82bcfe94a407ffb47ef554e391f7c7565cfe851d05f5d3c3c069cf0d9",
      "text": "彩的休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2704755c3bc7fed5c3f05398897d91f882a9862595764695ab2b2ba2e188bf5f",
      "text": "我回来啦喵～♪\n九郎君，吾辈的点心在哪喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d3b2cf991407fab7ce5d282ca2b8b7ba77eea18c618a4bfafebc6a79a234297",
      "text": "猫柳先生，欢迎回来。\n事不宜迟，请坐在那里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce07267353b675dbe720e73b3a55cd9ef104c2372f9e91a68a0b8bd4fb985c09",
      "text": "喵？吾辈明明什么都还没做就开启生气模式了吗！？\n明明也没迟到，为什么会这样喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66702ca8419cb6d1c0bc9b73fc2655d703429328f22a6deadc74122fdc32985b",
      "text": "九郎酱，太僵硬啦。\n小伙子都误会了不是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e45061222423d60de7a35fc92ab87a6e72a71012495b871049bd7d7f0d16ba42",
      "text": "实在抱歉，我对这种事情\n不太习惯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8183d116dfa20e7e4008a0d68038e4347073fae0412087adf6f591b3bf25b39",
      "text": "翔真先生，赶快把那个交给他吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6a7432a319f87f48cf935c10ae2a007691da266013b2ae01fb698b522bf4429",
      "text": "给，拿好。这是我们为小伙子你筹办的\n生日会邀请函哦。能收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4fb00c2d8a8c9df87d674599da44554f452e411761fbbc291463a9200939332",
      "text": "桐生先生？……整个人愣住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acc4962945a4a899a906c740925ac0753601f7d4fb86178b7dd168b3ef2b628a",
      "text": "没想到会让你这么惊讶。请问这\n算是感到高兴的意思吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24cf2e01721eb6bbbe241f7ea1e106a3060a8153cb98d4ca69c37b2e21fec652",
      "text": "是的！惊喜成功了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48c0896cdbe5a1b2601de5c6b680602baac44254b7c09f03bf807f5a2d6f6208",
      "text": "看来悄悄准备还是有意义的。\n在邀请函上写着的时间，记得来事务所哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天晚上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1abab3fbce99832b324da1c82fb46667012d103f17e4019efc970ab7185536dc",
      "text": "喵呼呼呼……吾辈的生日会邀请函！\n读多少遍都好开心喵～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b0831560d0e5a55ac5d3c895b39ebacf50169a2c00e6b7785e08f2762dc1a5c",
      "text": "好啦好啦，再从头重读一遍……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d00fd69bf5130a40c9bf1a14b1a0551c75cdf5ff6a4427ba3fa866379624c14",
      "text": "差不多该给我回个话了吧。浴室都空出来了，\n叫了你好几遍，是没长耳朵吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cef4c4796eabc69f81627fd09d1d302b4229a3be70b9f8ad9c65b8d49f34a4e7",
      "text": "哈，师父！\n想让你看看这个喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07dbc173aeef1f8724fd0fb275e6b28fb88998113ebef380437c8504f5ec911c",
      "text": "这是大家给吾辈的邀请函喵～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:751618576e13bf5fa97fab3d5e26e53eddd94e96180cceafae2ae7c83eb62fd6",
      "text": "生日会的邀请函？原来如此，回来之后\n就一直飘飘然的，就是因为这个啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f217553ab6e3ee26cd0719afd8f8737583e7ab8bca97e541a8bec5a252c47b",
      "text": "……真是的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:786a80e5c483d2506d6c698794d8cbb7f6af79ccbea70ca27c3646ef85a49554",
      "text": "就当是给你的生日礼物，回头听你慢慢讲吧。\n趁洗澡水还没凉，赶紧给我去洗澡。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f4dfc75b2f40baaee08a010c179acc926a9977c021434ace8459db852164a5b",
      "text": "喵！？礼物换成别的东西比较好喵！\n那吾辈就去洗澡了喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4d3b63873db5297fca2ec520e9aaa2b383e8abb6187b44c818ab87beb51b38e",
      "text": "生日当天清晨……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ceca5787c0e6bdc32418ab292086e281f079fe0985bfae130e9383bb9441d48",
      "text": "就算过生日要做的事也完全没变喵～。\n打扫、洗衣服、做饭，伺候师父。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d5f723466e7fc998fb421e9033de4080d8af2386b7ecad73a9a70c7b7f147f",
      "text": "首先打扫客房……嗯？\n蝴蝶先生发来的LINK……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0de206be8ad1e15b48bb344553581fd74e6b0cfcf9e96e72e322cfd883d1d829",
      "text": "哎呀呀，是视频！\n点一下喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f681a9594b44a59206e9a3114c57bb21c4eaff173edc6215a246f5e4622f046",
      "text": "小伙子，生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46bdc200c6114c210d0b194ce3e003d3ebdaa922fc241a234a5bc3af4e2b56c4",
      "text": "猫柳先生，祝您生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39115041c0825faf1266130cf24b9b64ceaa196cb14fcfa9cda143f3b84c84dd",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐，桐生先生！\n愿接下来的一年成为精彩美好的每一天！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aabcd00b0c5ef6d60a9f2561d0f64a760cd5cb0354881a24197d4eacc166db2",
      "text": "那么，待会儿见啦。\n敬请期待今天的生日会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34ffe428bfb1340ebe93c3b4018db51852894bd34498862b0b701b326abd8d1c",
      "text": "那是当然的喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0504205b983484749c69704499c65059a0b076de90d0ff0296f4c0b7e888d1c",
      "text": "这可是头等大事。得让师父也看看！\n师父，又有东西想给你看了喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
